                            {
                                "example_id": "5c23bd39-71db-4a7c-9cd2-61ae36cae1e5",
                                "sense_id": "175ddb97-90a7-38e3-9fdf-471d9b0fbf6c",
                                "text": "\"What's the first name?\" - - -\n\"I have a horrible feeling that it's Lancelot!\"\n\"Good God!\" said Archie.\n\"It couldn't really be that, could it?\"\nArchie looked grave. He hated to give pain, but he felt he must be honest.\n\"It might,\" he said. \"People give their children all sorts of rummy names. My second name's Tracy. And I have a pal in England who was christened Cuthbert De la Hay Horace. Fortunately everyone calls him Stinker.\""
                            }
